# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
#
# 注意：必须锚定到仓库根（前导 /），不能写裸的 `debug` / `target`。
# 裸规则在任意层级生效，会把源码目录一并吞掉——
# `crates/strixmaid-server/src/debug/`（design.md §12.1 的调试页）就是这么丢的。
/target/
/debug/

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# RustRover
#  JetBrains specific template is maintained in a separate JetBrains.gitignore that can
#  be found at https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Global/JetBrains.gitignore
#  and can be added to the global gitignore or merged into this file.  For a more nuclear
#  option (not recommended) you can uncomment the following to ignore the entire idea folder.
#.idea/


# Added by cargo

web/node_modules/
web/*.tsbuildinfo
web/.vite/

# 前端构建产物。**不跟踪**：它是 web/src 的派生物，跟踪一份快照必然与源码漂移
# （改了组件忘了重建，仓库里那份就是旧的）。由打包脚本在出包前构建，
# 见 scripts/package.sh 与 scripts/package-windows.ps1。
#
# 代价：新克隆后先构建前端才能编 strixmaid-server。**debug 也一样**——
# rust-embed 的 `folder` 在两档都于编译期求值，目录不存在就直接报错；
# 区别只是 debug 允许目录为空，release 还要真有 index.html 可嵌。
# crates/strixmaid-server/build.rs 会在缺失时给出一句可操作的提示。
web/dist/

# StrixMaid 运行时产物
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
